    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "For Photography Media Arts students admitted Fall 2025 and after: Students must complete a total of two single-term courses (or equivalent) from Table I and two single-term courses (or equivalent) from Table II. This table is grouped into areas of focus for the benefit of students who want to build skills and knowledge in specific areas. Students can choose courses from any area of focus and are not required to complete a minimum number of courses in any area.",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Table I",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/programs/fcad/image_arts/photomedia_table_i/"
        }
